## 📖 Project Description

The Music Playlist Management System is a console-based Java application that simulates the behavior of a digital music playlist.

The system allows users to:

* Add songs to a playlist
* Store song information
* Display the playlist queue
* Shuffle songs randomly

The project demonstrates Object-Oriented Programming concepts such as Aggregation (HAS-A Relationship), Arrays of Objects, Encapsulation, and Randomization Algorithms.

