## 🏗 Class Design

### Song Class

Represents a music track.

#### Attributes

* title
* artist

#### Methods

* getTitle()
* getArtist()

---

### Playlist Class

Represents a collection of songs.

#### Attributes

* Song[] songs
* int count

#### Methods

* addSong()
* displayPlaylist()
* shufflePlaylist()

