## 🧠 OOP Concepts Used

### Encapsulation

Private fields with public getter methods.

### Aggregation (HAS-A Relationship)

```java
private Song[] songs;
```

A Playlist HAS-A collection of Song objects.

### Arrays of Objects

```java
Song[] songs = new Song[10];
```

### Randomization

Fisher-Yates Shuffle Algorithm is used to randomly rearrange songs.

### Enhanced For Loop

```java
for(Song s : songs)
```

Used for playlist traversal.

